    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633320/extras/9eeaa78f03251860d8607819c61f2f1c.avif?t=1750848845\" width=250 height=250 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iwezei's young security officer meets a mysterious girl from a distant land and embarks on a fantastic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter ancient or modern, from east to west, some things remain unchanged. After experiencing many things, what choices will young people make?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the journey of &quot;dispelling disasters&quot; - the journey of eliminating calamities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Stage-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iweze, the abandoned town of God, and the wider world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are gods born, exist, and leave?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fire swept Sheriff Frey into a disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown shadows, mysterious girls, and even the &quot;legend&quot; itself... Frey is forced to know more and more &quot;secrets&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this is not just a journey to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness breeds in the shadows, natural disasters and man-made calamities, and all effects have causes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything may change with the 'choice'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or perhaps, under divine scrutiny, there is no other choice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
